### Create a new room
POST http://localhost:5000/api/rooms/create
Content-Type: application/json

{ 
  "name": "room 1",
  "capacity": "ONEBEDROOM",
  "rentAmount": "6000",
  "description": "the first room to ever be created"
}

### Fetch all rooms
GET http://localhost:5000/api/rooms/

### Create new Tenancy
